It's easy to take a magic chest from a dead giant.	從死去的巨人身上拿走金盒子很容易。
The giant squashed the life out of you.  Next time, use your sling from a distance.	巨人把你活活壓死了。下次記得從遠處使用你的投石器。
Uh-oh.  You happen to be standing in the giant's favorite spot for a snooze.	糟了。你剛好站在巨人最愛打盹的地方。
The giant is getting tired of looking for you.  Seems like he may be getting ready to take a nap.	巨人找你找得累了，看樣子他可能準備要打個盹。
Good job!  The huge giant, tuckered out from stomping around, has fallen fast asleep.	做得好！這個巨人到處跺步跺得筋疲力盡，已經沉沉睡去。
The giant cannot see you since you are invisible.	你隱形了，巨人看不見你。
Fortunately, you have the magic shield with you.  It's preventing the giant from pulverizing you!	幸好你身上帶著靈盾，它擋住了巨人，沒讓你被壓成肉泥！
The fairy godmother's spell is protecting you.	教母的魔法正保護著你。
Talk about overkill--he's dead already!	這也太多此一舉了——他已經死了！
Not when you're invisible!	你隱形的時候可不行！
Now that he's asleep, he's completely harmless.  There's no reason to hurt him.	他現在睡著了，完全沒有威脅，沒理由傷害他。
Not now.	現在不行。
You see the entrance to a cave within the mountaintop.	你看見山頂上有個洞穴入口。
It sure is dark in there!	裡面可真暗！
From outside, you can see the entrance to a cave carved into the side of the mountain.	從外面望去，你看見山壁上鑿出的一個洞穴入口。
This is the craggy peak of Daventry's mountain.  Amidst the rocks and boulders piled here, there's a dark opening leading into the mountain itself.	這裡是戴凡確王國山脈嶙峋的山頂。在這堆滿岩石與巨礫之間，有個通往山內部的黑暗開口。
There are some truly stupendous trees up here!	這上面有些真正巨大驚人的樹木！
You're on top of the clouds!	你站在雲端之上！
There is a hole at the bottom of one of the trees.	其中一棵樹的根部有個洞。
You can't see inside the hole from here.	從這裡看不到洞裡面。
You see a slingshot in the hole.	你看見洞裡有一把投石器。
The hole is empty.	洞裡是空的。
What slingshot?	什麼投石器？
This slingshot is made of very stretchy leather.	這把投石器是用非常有彈性的皮革做的。
You reach into the hole and pull out the leather slingshot.	你把手伸進洞裡，拉出那把皮革投石器。
You can't climb down the tree when you're invisible.	你隱形時沒辦法爬下這棵樹。
You should be able to walk on the tree trunk from here, if you're very careful!	只要非常小心，你應該能從這裡走上樹幹！
Far out on a huge branch, there is a nest.	在一根粗大的樹枝遠處，有個鳥巢。
Don't look down from here!  You might get dizzy and loose your footing.	別往下看！你可能會頭暈而失足。
There is a perfect, shimmering golden egg lying in the nest.	鳥巢裡躺著一顆完美無瑕、閃閃發光的金蛋。
You're too far away from the nest to see it clearly.	你離鳥巢太遠，看不清楚。
You're looking at an empty nest.	你看著一個空鳥巢。
You're not close enough to the nest.	你離鳥巢不夠近。
There's nothing at all in the nest.	鳥巢裡什麼都沒有。
Among the branches sits a small nest with a beautiful golden egg.	樹枝間有個小鳥巢，裡頭放著一顆美麗的金蛋。
One of the birds may need it, but you won't.  Leave it alone.	也許某隻鳥需要它，但你不需要。別動它。
You've already taken the only egg in the nest.	你已經拿走了鳥巢裡唯一的蛋。
You carefully lift the golden egg out of the nest.	你小心翼翼地把金蛋從鳥巢裡取出。
As you fall, the magic ring slips from your finger.	你墜落時，魔戒從你的手指上滑落。
As soon as you entered the gingerbread house, the goat ran off.  Something sure spooked him from this place!	你一走進薑餅屋，山羊就跑走了。這地方顯然把他嚇壞了！
Your ring mysteriously stops working in here.	你的戒指在這裡莫名其妙失去了效力。
Off in the distance you hear a high, squeaky voice say, "I can smell someone tasty in my house."	遠處傳來一個尖細的聲音說：「我聞到我家裡有個美味的傢伙。」
At the moment, it's important NOT to let the witch know you're here.	眼下最重要的是別讓巫婆知道你在這裡。
Though the outside of this house was tempting, there's nothing inside that seems remotely edible.	這間房子外觀雖然誘人，裡頭卻沒有任何看起來能吃的東西。
You've killed the witch!	你殺死了巫婆！
There is no witch here... AT THE MOMENT!!	這裡目前沒有巫婆……暫時沒有！！
Too late...she sees you, and you're in trouble.	太遲了……她看見你了，你麻煩大了。
You can't kill the witch now.	你現在沒辦法殺死巫婆。
There is nothing here that's worth putting in the bucket...certainly not that awful green goop.	這裡沒有什麼值得放進水桶的東西……那攤噁心的綠色黏液肯定不算。
You don't have the bucket.	你身上沒有水桶。
In contrast to its delightful exterior, the inside of the gingerbread house looks dark and ominous.	和討人喜歡的外觀相反，薑餅屋內部看起來陰暗又不祥。
It looks like an ordinary bedroom.	這看起來像是一間普通的臥室。
You can't see much from where you are.	你從這個位置看不到什麼。
All you see are a few gingerbread crumbs lying on the floor of the cage.  You wonder about this.	你只看見鐵籠地板上散落著幾片薑餅屑，讓你不禁納悶。
Yech!!!!	噁！！！！
The sickening stench from the pot is everywhere.	鍋子散發出的惡臭瀰漫四周。
Since there's no door here, you don't have anything to open.	這裡沒有門，你沒有東西可以打開。
The bars are far too strong for you to bend.	這些鐵欄杆太堅固了，你沒辦法弄彎。
It is already open.	已經是開著的了。
It is already closed.	已經是關著的了。
There isn't any here.	這裡沒有。
The pot is hot enough to burn your hand.  The fire must have been burning for a long time.	鍋子燙得足以燙傷你的手，這火想必已經燒了很久。
You briefly consider diving into the foul brew, but your desire to remain alive prevails over your rather strange inclination.	你一度考慮跳進這鍋噁心的濃湯裡，但求生的欲望戰勝了這個奇怪的念頭。
You wouldn't want to sleep on a witch's bed.	你不會想睡在巫婆的床上。
You may have seen a bed in the other room, but I am not sure.	你或許在另一個房間看過一張床，但我不太確定。
The ring does not seem to work in the witch's house.	戒指在巫婆的屋子裡似乎不管用。
Now is not a good time to try and start a conversation!	現在不是找人聊天的好時機！
The witch is in the other room.	巫婆在另一個房間。
This ugly old witch is one of the most hideous sights you have ever seen.  Her eyes are dark and evil, and her crooked smile twitches hungrily.  She's not to be trusted.	這個醜陋的老巫婆，是你見過最駭人的景象之一。她的雙眼陰暗邪惡，歪斜的笑容飢渴地抽動著。她絕對信不過。
The fire is very, very hot.  It's best to leave it alone.	這把火非常非常燙，最好別去碰它。
As the green liquid is terribly goopy, the fire must have been burning underneath it for quite some time.	這攤綠色液體黏稠得可怕，下面的火想必已經燒了好一段時間。
That smoke smells... and even LOOKS evil!	那股煙聞起來……看起來都邪惡極了！
The cabinet on the wall is rather plain and simple.	牆上的櫥櫃相當樸素簡單。
There is nothing but a bare shelf here.	這裡只有一個空蕩蕩的架子。
Sitting on the shelf is a delicious piece of Swiss cheese.	架子上放著一塊美味的瑞士乳酪。
It's just a stool.	這只是一張凳子。
You don't see a note here.	你在這裡沒看到紙條。
Your eyes are not sharp enough to see it from here.	你的視力不夠好，沒辦法從這裡看清楚。
It is written in a familiar language.	上面寫的是你熟悉的語言。
You see a note on the table by the bed.	你看見床邊的桌上有張紙條。
Be thankful that you are invisible or the witch may have stuck around to try and catch you!	慶幸自己是隱形的吧，不然巫婆可能會留下來抓你！
Be thankful that you have a protective spell or the witch may have stuck around to try and catch you!	慶幸自己有守護魔法吧，不然巫婆可能會留下來抓你！
You take the cheese from the cabinet.	你從櫥櫃裡拿出乳酪。
You grab the note from the table.	你從桌上拿起紙條。
Rats! She has cast some spell to keep you from escaping! The witch remarks, "Oh, how nice of you to come for dinner (cackle, cackle)!"	糟了！她施了某種魔法讓你逃不掉！巫婆說道：「喔，你能來吃晚餐真是太好了（咯咯笑）！」
She looks you over carefully, then states, "You're a little too scrawny for my appetite, but I think you're going to make a lovely dessert!"	她仔細打量你一番，然後說：「你瘦了點，不合我的胃口，不過我想你會是道美味的甜點！」
You need to get closer.  But be careful!	你得靠近一點，但要小心！
It would be easier if you were standing.	你站著的話會容易一些。
There has to be a better way to get rid of this evil old hag!	一定有更好的辦法能除掉這個邪惡的老太婆！
Perhaps you could shoot her if you had a gun and a silver bullet, but you'll find neither of those items in this game. Try to find another way.	如果你有槍和銀色子彈，或許能一槍解決她，但這款遊戲裡沒有這兩樣東西，想想別的辦法吧。
The witch mutters, "I am going to get my cauldron ready to cook someone for dinner (yum)."	巫婆喃喃道：「我要去把大鍋準備好，煮個人來當晚餐（嗯，真香）。」
The witch mumbles, "After I get the cauldron nice and hot, I will be ready to have someone for dinner (giggle)."	巫婆嘀咕著：「等我把大鍋燒得夠熱，就能請人來吃晚餐了（咯咯）。」
The witch mutters, "The cauldron is heating up nicely.  I wonder who will be my dinner guest!"	巫婆喃喃道：「大鍋燒得正好，不知道誰會是我的晚餐貴客呢！」
The witch says, "My cauldron is now the perfect temperature.  It is time to invite someone for dinner (cackle, cackle)!"	巫婆說：「我的大鍋現在溫度剛剛好，是時候邀請誰來吃晚餐了（咯咯笑）！」
The witch sees you!	巫婆看見你了！
D..d..did you see that? Nah! You're imagining things.	你……你剛剛看到了嗎？不會吧！是你自己在胡思亂想。
You can't do that while you're invisible.	你隱形的時候沒辦法這麼做。
You need to be a little closer for a good look.	你得靠近一點才能看清楚。
That's in the other room.	那個在另一個房間。
With a mighty shove, you courageously push the wicked witch into the pot.  Her wild screams are suddenly cut off as she melts away into the oily green slime in the pot.  Congratulations!	你用力一推，勇敢地把邪惡的巫婆推進鍋裡。她狂亂的尖叫聲戛然而止，融化成鍋裡油膩的綠色黏液。恭喜你！
The oily green slime spilled over when you pushed the witch into the pot.	你把巫婆推進鍋裡時，油膩的綠色黏液溢了出來。
The cage is made from strong, thick iron bars.  They look a little rusty, but they're solid through and through.	這個鐵籠是用堅固厚實的鐵欄杆做成的。看起來有點生鏽，但從頭到尾都十分堅固。
The witch's bed looks hard and uncomfortable.	巫婆的床看起來又硬又不舒服。
It is just a plain, wooden bedside table.	這只是一張樸素的木製床頭桌。
It looks like there is a note lying on top of it.	上面看起來放著一張紙條。
That is the table where the witch eats her food, whatever... or WHOever...that is!	那是巫婆用餐的桌子，不管吃的是什麼東西……或者是什麼人！
There aren't any spider webs in here, as far as you can see.	就你所見，這裡沒有任何蜘蛛網。
There is a spider web above the door.	門的上方有張蜘蛛網。
You can't open that.	你沒辦法打開那個。
There is a large cave here.  It continues deeper into the mountain.	這裡有個寬敞的洞穴，向著山的更深處延伸。
You have come from deep inside the mountain.  There is a door here.	你從山的深處來到這裡，這裡有扇門。
You'd cut your hands to ribbons trying to climb these rocky walls.	想爬上這些岩壁，你的手會被割得傷痕累累。
This is a heavy oaken door set into the side of the cave.	這是一扇嵌在洞壁上的厚重橡木門。
Try moving closer to the door.	試著再靠近門一點。
The walkway is made from large wooden planks, attached firmly to the cave's walls and floor.	這條步道是用粗大的木板搭成，牢牢固定在洞穴的牆壁與地面上。
The suspended walkway seems to wind forever down into the very bowels of the mountain.	這條懸空步道彷彿無止盡地蜿蜒而下，通往山的最深處。
There is no dwarf here.	這裡沒有矮人。
Suddenly, a small dwarf runs out of the shadows and approaches you.	突然，一個矮小的矮人從陰影中衝出來，朝你走近。
It's a good thing you are protected by a spell.  That little dwarf likes to steal treasures.	幸好你受到魔法保護，那個矮人最愛偷寶物了。
Being invisible has protected you, and your treasures, from the dwarf.	隱形保護了你和你的寶物，沒讓矮人得逞。
The sneaky little dwarf came by to see what you had...but nothing caught his fancy.	這個鬼鬼祟祟的矮人跑來看看你有什麼……但沒有一樣入得了他的眼。
The sneaky little dwarf caught you by surprise.  Did he steal anything from you?	這個鬼鬼祟祟的矮人趁你不備突然出現，他有沒有偷走你什麼東西呢？
The walkway is made from large wooden planks, attached firmly to the cave's walls and floor, and suspended from the ceiling.	這條步道是用粗大的木板搭成，牢牢固定在洞穴的牆壁與地面上，並從天花板懸吊而下。
You see the goat below you, wandering off to explore Daventry on his own.	你看見山羊在你下方，獨自四處遊蕩探索戴凡確王國。
The view of Daventry from up here is stunning.  There are gently rolling hills and valleys as far as the eye can see.  Off in the distance, clouds float far above the land.	從這裡俯瞰戴凡確王國的景色美不勝收。放眼望去盡是起伏平緩的丘陵與山谷，遠方雲朵飄浮在大地之上。
The goat wasn't about to risk his life climbing that huge beanstalk!  You see him wandering away.	山羊可不打算冒著生命危險爬上那根巨大的豆莖！你看見他徑自走開了。
There is no goat anywhere in sight.	放眼望去哪裡都沒有山羊。
Nervously, you look down. You can see the beautiful Daventry countryside spread out beneath you. However, looking down makes you a little dizzy, so you turn your attention back to the task at hand.	你緊張地往下看，看見美麗的戴凡確王國鄉間在腳下展開。不過往下看讓你有點頭暈，於是你把注意力轉回眼前的事情上。
The beanstalk disappears up into the clouds.	豆莖向上延伸，消失在雲層之中。
You are too high to see anything below you in detail.	你的位置太高了，看不清楚下方的細節。
